Vance Oduya spreads his berth logs across the dispenser's housing, since it is the only flat surface in the pens. He runs a blunt finger down the column and stops. "Courier cleared the Hollow Spire at second bell, bound spinward. A tanker crew watched her go and logged the heading." You copy the heading down. He taps a smudged name beside it, then looks at you. "Hers is the only one I'd trust. She asked what you were paying."

