Vance's finger stops on the smudged name. "Ascendancy's been buying berths? That's no news to me." He does not look up from the logs. "Funny thing is, the tanker crew's berth was one of them. Paid through the quarter, no questions."

He taps the page twice, slow, then finally meets your eye. "So when she asks what you're paying, you might ask who's paying her already."

